      "sourceTextSha256": "04fb937e9a110b4a4ba95fb966a66b7ee786150cedf33e255bb7bcc24f7b894f",
      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast at the hotel. At the scheduled time, transfer to the airport with your driver for your flight to Medellín, known as the City of Eternal Spring. Upon arrival, you will be welcomed by your private English-speaking guide, who will accompany you throughout your stay in Medellín In the afternoon, discover Medellín on a panoramic city tour, exploring a city that has undergone a remarkable transformation and emerged as one of Latin America’s most dynamic centres of culture, innovation and urban development.\n\nReturn to the hotel.\n\nNot included: Flight Bogotá – Medellín",
